## Infrastructure Security
- HTTPS everywhere (ACM certificates on CloudFront + API Gateway).
- WAF on CloudFront and API Gateway (OWASP core rule set).
- VPC for Aurora and RDS Proxy — Lambda in private subnets with NAT gateway.
- Enable CloudTrail for audit logging of all AWS API calls.
